<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100110" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεξ-ανίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stir up</i> or <i>excite together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.44c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with aor. 2 and pf.
				Act.
			, <i>rise and come forth with</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; <i>to be roused to action</i> or <i>ready for action
				with</i> or <i>together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμα τισί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pyrrh.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat. Mi.</u>
				59
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τοῖς καιροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.9.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rise in rebellion, revolt along with</i> or <i>together</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.39.4
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				71.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to be in enthusiastic sympathy with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτῳ ταῖς ὁρμαῖς</span>, of the crowd at a
			wrestling-match, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				27.9.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
